# Build output. The .c sources and bench.h are the artifact; binaries and .s
# dumps are regenerated by the build line in README.md.
#
# A LIST OF NAMES DRIFTS: this started as three explicit binaries and three more
# benchmarks were added the same afternoon, all of which git then tried to
# commit. Match on shape instead.
bench_*
!bench_*.c
!bench.h
*.s
*.o
*.dSYM/
# Same rule for the exhaustive proofs: sources kept, binaries and the header
# extracted from cn1_globals.h at build time are not.
test_*
!test_*.c
!test_*.sh
*_extracted.h
